# Workflow

Blocked for commits: `main`, `master`, `production`, `release`.

Branch naming: `feature/<short-name>` or `fix/<short-name>`.

## Local (primary clone on main)

Keep the primary clone on `main`. Develop in a separate worktree:

```bash
git fetch origin main
git worktree add ../codelint-<short-name> -b feature/<short-name> origin/main
cd ../codelint-<short-name>
# implement, commit, push
```

After merge:

```bash
git fetch --prune origin
git worktree remove ../codelint-<short-name>
git branch -d feature/<short-name>
```

Do not `git checkout` a feature branch in the primary `main` clone.

## Cursor Cloud

Single checkout — create the branch in place (no sibling worktree required):

```bash
git fetch origin main
git switch -c feature/<short-name> origin/main
```

## Pull requests

```bash
gh pr create --base main --head feature/<short-name>
```

When asked to "submit PR": create the PR, then `gh run watch --exit-status`, and fix CI before reporting done.
